{"4394890": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Ice Age", "steam_appid": 4394890, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Become a primitive human to experience primitive life, surviving and hunting in a wild prehistoric world.</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A vast and magnificent prehistoric world, You can choose between maps showing different climates and landforms for winter and summer.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Pet taming and riding system: Tame and ride various animals, including large beasts like mammoths and sabretooth.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Hunt various realistic prehistoric behemoths, such as mammoths, saber-toothed tigers, giant wolves, boars, and bears.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Supports single-player and multiplayer modes; create your own server and play with friends.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A rich crafting and building system allows you to construct various buildings and craft weapons and tools to build a safe and warm home.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >An agricultural system allows you to grow various vegetables and fruits, and plant trees.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fishing and swimming systems are also included.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A dynamic weather system: Immersive natural environment with real-time dynamic weather changes and a day-night cycle.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Supports free switching between first-person and third-person perspectives.</p></li></ul>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Become a primitive human to experience primitive life, surviving and hunting in a wild prehistoric world.</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A vast and magnificent prehistoric world, You can choose between maps showing different climates and landforms for winter and summer.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Pet taming and riding system: Tame and ride various animals, including large beasts like mammoths and sabretooth.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Hunt various realistic prehistoric behemoths, such as mammoths, saber-toothed tigers, giant wolves, boars, and bears.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Supports single-player and multiplayer modes; create your own server and play with friends.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A rich crafting and building system allows you to construct various buildings and craft weapons and tools to build a safe and warm home.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >An agricultural system allows you to grow various vegetables and fruits, and plant trees.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fishing and swimming systems are also included.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A dynamic weather system: Immersive natural environment with real-time dynamic weather changes and a day-night cycle.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Supports free switching between first-person and third-person perspectives.</p></li></ul>", "short_description": "As primitive human, in the wild Ice Age prehistoric world, Hunt and tame wild beasts such as mammoths and sabretooth, build homes, and survive.", "supported_languages": "English, French, Italian, German, Spanish - Spain, Danish, Ukrainian, Russian, Bulgarian, Hungarian, Turkish, Greek, Norwegian, Czech, Japanese, Polish, Swedish, Simplified Chinese, Traditional Chinese, Finnish, Dutch, Portuguese - Brazil, Vietnamese, Korean, Indonesian, Romanian, Portuguese - Portugal, Spanish - Latin America, Malay", "header_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4394890/a421bac255e9c67ebff5b802cfaf529f07b880b3/header.jpg?t=1787802356", "capsule_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4394890/94545fb977123f709c3321b50fd1704184e1b22c/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1787802356", "capsule_imagev5": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/stea